            <div xml:id="d671">

                <pb facs="0852" n="738" sameAs="frus:frus1924v01/pg738"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">8903.01/190: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Herrick</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-03-14T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 14,
                                1924—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>85. Your 105, March 7, noon.</p>
                <p>Department concurs in omission of reference to “conversations” in first line of
                    draft note contained in Department’s 64, February 28, 3 p.m. You may proceed to
                    immediate signature of convention in English and in French and to exchange of
                    communications as heretofore outlined. President has issued full power reading
                    as follows:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
